FREELANG_PROFILE=1 freelang my_program.fl
```

출력 예:
```
[PROFILE] ThreadPool: 8 workers, 1000 tasks
[PROFILE] Average wait time: 2.3μs
[PROFILE] Max latency: 145μs
[PROFILE] Total throughput: 434K tasks/sec
```

